---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/contracts-budget-drift-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/contracts-budget-drift-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Eight of the eleven word budgets went up between the Sunday lock and the merge"
  caption="The benchmark file's word budget per screen state at two commits: the Sunday-night lock and the merge five days later. Each raise carries its reason in the test file."
>
  Dot chart of the browser benchmark's word budget for eleven screen states, as locked on Sunday night and as merged
  five days later, against a 15-word target. Scan stayed at 9, Result at 15 and Already inspected at 17. Order ready
  went from 3 to 16, Tape playing from 8 to 10, Fail while picking a symptom from 3 to 10, Fail with Other needing a
  note from 10 to 17, Exception from 15 to 17, Could not inspect from 15 to 17, Round 2 ready from 13 to 28, and Round 2
  tape from 18 to 20. At the lock two budgets sat over 15; at merge seven did.
</Chart>
